    <guid isPermaLink="false">68443caa79e285b9b8b793d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Jun 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>三位老友时隔9个月重启麦克风！前幼教老师Ethan揭秘墨尔本房产销售内幕：</span><br><span>🔥 </span><strong><span>【转型实录】</span></strong><span> 伊森逃离幼教行业真相：从被熊孩子折磨到被土豪客户追捧</span><br><span>🏗️ </span><strong><span>【暴利杠杆】</span></strong><span> 台湾买家10%首付扫楼全解析：转楼花套利/印花税漏洞/2029新房断供预警</span><br><span>💸 </span><strong><span>【租金暴涨】</span></strong><span> Docklands周租$1000的幕后推手：留学生激增vs加息断供潮</span><br><span>⚠️ </span><strong><span>【税务暗雷】</span></strong><span> 海外投资生死局：8%附加税+4%离席费VS上海房价租金比</span><br><span>🔮 </span><strong><span>【下期预告】</span></strong><span> 长江换汇暴雷内部文件首曝（伊森：“颠覆普通人认知”）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a> 幼教老师变身Collins Street西装暴徒</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> 海外买家bug：无PR竟能买百套房</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 惊爆租金现状：Docklands两房周租$1000</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 台湾客疯狂扫货背后的汇率秘密</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 房产销售黑话教学："转楼花"套利全流程</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> 税务炸弹：8%海外税+4%离席费避坑指南</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2112">35:12</a> 2029年危机：墨尔本新房断供预警</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 首富秘闻：大连出生的犹太地产之王</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong><span>：Ethan老师、William威廉、Zack扎克</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【联系方式】</span></strong><span>：zzytalk@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
