  <item>
    <title>006. Manner咖啡事件启示：身边的好服务与坏服务</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66af44fc33ddcbb53c2e65df</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66af44fc33ddcbb53c2e65df</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Aug 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在本期，我们聚焦于“好服务与坏服务”的主题，分享了一系列真实的服务体验故事。从出租车司机的恶劣态度到高端餐厅的贴心服务，从医院的皇帝般待遇到个别商家的歧视行为，我们的主播们以顾客和服务业从业者的双重视角，探讨了服务质量的重要性以及它对我们日常生活的影响。本期节目不仅揭示了服务行业中存在的问题，也赞扬了那些提供卓越服务的个人和企业。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> 虹桥火车站的出租车经历</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 酒店前台与出租车司机的冲突解决</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> 北京首都机场的出租车政策</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> 酒店前台的机器人送外卖服务</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> 租房中介与买房中介的服务对比</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1367">22:47</a> 澳大利亚医院的皇帝般待遇</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1794">29:54</a> 烤鸭店的超预期服务</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1931">32:11</a> 生日饭店的精致伴手礼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 香港服务业的普遍问题</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">37:23</a> 国外中餐馆的服务体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">43:13</a> 服务行业的顾客与服务者视角</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 销售策略对顾客决策的影响</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】：Ethan老师、William威廉、Zack扎克</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系方式】：zzytalk@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
